 "lines": [
  {
   "n": 1,
   "start": 0.0,
   "duration": 17.0,
   "speaker": "rysina",
   "voice": {
    "event": "Cutscenes/Ferris4/CS_FR_PortalRysina01",
    "wave": "CS_FR_PortalRysina01",
    "bank": "SFX/Voice/Voice_CS_FR602_02_cs_rus.bsb",
    "ogg": "voice/01.ogg",
    "mp3": "voice/01.mp3",
    "duration": 3.356
   },
   "clips": [],
   "animations": [],
   "text": {
    "ru": "Отлично, у нас есть время. Не будем медлить.",
    "en": "Great, we have some time. Let's not waste it.",
    "fr": "Parfait, nous avons un peu de temps. Ne le gaspillons pas."
   },
   "source": "World/Quests/Ferris_indoor/Ferris_3_4_2/Portal_Sub8.(ClientData).xdb"
  },
  {
   "n": 2,
   "start": 8.0,
   "duration": 17.0,
   "speaker": "diarder",
   "voice": {
    "event": "Cutscenes/Ferris4/CS_FR_PortalMarianna01",
    "wave": "CS_FR_PortalMarianna01",
    "bank": "SFX/Voice/Voice_CS_FR602_02_cs_rus.bsb",
    "ogg": "voice/02.ogg",
    "mp3": "voice/02.mp3",
    "duration": 4.006
   },
   "clips": [],
   "animations": [],
   "text": {
    "ru": "Думаю, скоро здесь появится целая армия архитекторов.",
    "en": "I think very soon a whole army of Architects will be here.",
    "fr": "Je pense que toute une armée d'Architectes arrivera bientôt ici."
   },
   "source": "World/Quests/Ferris_indoor/Ferris_3_4_2/Portal_Sub1.(ClientData).xdb"
  },
  {
   "n": 3,
   "start": 13.0,
   "duration": 17.0,
   "speaker": "diarder",
   "voice": {
    "event": "Cutscenes/Ferris4/CS_FR_PortalMarianna02",
    "wave": "CS_FR_PortalMarianna02",
    "bank": "SFX/Voice/Voice_CS_FR602_02_cs_rus.bsb",
    "ogg": "voice/03.ogg",
    "mp3": "voice/03.mp3",
    "duration": 5.006
   },
   "clips": [],
   "animations": [],
   "text": {
    "ru": "Мы должны запечатать портал. Нельзя позволить им прорваться в наш мир!",
    "en": "We have to seal the portal. We cannot let them break into our world!",
    "fr": "Nous devons fermer le portail. Nous ne pouvons pas les laisser pénétrer dans notre monde !"
   },
   "source": "World/Quests/Ferris_indoor/Ferris_3_4_2/Portal_Sub2.(ClientData).xdb"
  },
  {
   "n": 4,
   "start": 19.0,
   "duration": 17.0,
   "speaker": "diarder",
   "voice": {
    "event": "Cutscenes/Ferris4/CS_FR_PortalMarianna03",
    "wave": "CS_FR_PortalMarianna03",
    "bank": "SFX/Voice/Voice_CS_FR602_02_cs_rus.bsb",
    "ogg": "voice/04.ogg",
    "mp3": "voice/04.mp3",
    "duration": 6.256
   },
   "clips": [],
   "animations": [],
   "text": {
    "ru": "Заклятье требует долгой подготовки, и нам потребуется защита. Будьте готовы ко всему.",
    "en": "The spell requires long preparation, and we will need protection. Be prepared to anything.",
    "fr": "Le sort est long à préparer, et nous aurons besoin de protection. Attendez-vous à tout."
   },
   "source": "World/Quests/Ferris_indoor/Ferris_3_4_2/Portal_Sub9.(ClientData).xdb"
  },
  {
   "n": 5,
   "start": 25.0,
   "duration": 17.0,
   "speaker": "diarder",
   "voice": {
    "event": "Cutscenes/Ferris4/CS_FR_PortalMarianna04",
    "wave": "CS_FR_PortalMarianna04",
    "bank": "SFX/Voice/Voice_CS_FR602_02_cs_rus.bsb",
    "ogg": "voice/05.ogg",
    "mp3": "voice/05.mp3",
    "duration": 1.444
   },
   "clips": [],
   "animations": [],
   "text": {
    "ru": "И да поможет нам Свет.",
    "en": "May the Light be with us!",
    "fr": "Que la Lumière soit avec nous !"
   },
   "source": "World/Quests/Ferris_indoor/Ferris_3_4_2/Portal_Sub10.(ClientData).xdb"
  },
  {
   "n": 6,
   "start": 27.5,
   "duration": 17.0,
   "speaker": null,
   "voice": {
    "event": "Cutscenes/Ferris4/CS_FR_PortalArch01",
    "wave": "CS_FR_PortalArch01",
    "bank": "SFX/Voice/Voice_CS_FR602_cs_rus.bsb",
    "ogg": "voice/06.ogg",
    "mp3": "voice/06.mp3",
    "duration": 8.068
   },
   "clips": [],
   "animations": [],
   "text": {
    "ru": "Вторжение. Хаос. Отвратительно.",
    "en": "Invasion. Chaos. Disgusting.",
    "fr": "Une invasion Le Chaos. C'est répugnant."
   },
   "source": "World/Quests/Ferris_indoor/Ferris_3_4_2/Portal_Sub3.(ClientData).xdb"
  },
  {
   "n": 7,
   "start": 43.5,
   "duration": 17.0,
   "speaker": "rysina",
   "voice": {
    "event": "Cutscenes/Ferris4/CS_FR_PortalRysina02",
    "wave": "CS_FR_PortalRysina02",
    "bank": "SFX/Voice/Voice_CS_FR602_02_cs_rus.bsb",
    "ogg": "voice/07.ogg",
    "mp3": "voice/07.mp3",
    "duration": 5.821
   },
   "clips": [],
   "animations": [],
   "text": {
    "ru": "Что ещё за... Убейте эту тварь, пока не поздно!",
    "en": "What the... Kill this monster before it's too late!",
    "fr": "Nom de... Tuez ce monstre avant qu'il ne soit trop tard !"
   },
   "source": "World/Quests/Ferris_indoor/Ferris_3_4_2/Portal_Sub4.(ClientData).xdb"
  },
  {
   "n": 8,
   "start": 48.5,
   "duration": 17.0,
   "speaker": "diarder",
   "voice": {
    "event": "Cutscenes/Ferris4/CS_FR_PortalMarianna05",
    "wave": "CS_FR_PortalMarianna05",
    "bank": "SFX/Voice/Voice_CS_FR602_02_cs_rus.bsb",
    "ogg": "voice/08.ogg",
    "mp3": "voice/08.mp3",
    "duration": 3.256
   },
   "clips": [],
   "animations": [],
   "text": {
    "ru": "Портал не закроется, пока оно живо!",
    "en": "The portal will not close while it's still alive!",
    "fr": "Le portail ne se fermera pas tant qu'il sera en vie !"
   },
   "source": "World/Quests/Ferris_indoor/Ferris_3_4_2/Portal_Sub5.(ClientData).xdb"
  },
  {
   "n": 9,
   "start": 52.5,
   "duration": 17.0,
   "speaker": null,
   "voice": {
    "event": "Cutscenes/Ferris4/CS_FR_PortalArch02",
    "wave": "CS_FR_PortalArch02",
    "bank": "SFX/Voice/Voice_CS_FR602_cs_rus.bsb",
    "ogg": "voice/09.ogg",
    "mp3": "voice/09.mp3",
    "duration": 5.42
   },
   "clips": [],
   "animations": [],
   "text": {
    "ru": "Вы нарушили цельность Фрактала. Осквернили Путь.",
    "en": "You have disrupted the wholeness of the Fractal. You have desecrated the Passage.",
    "fr": "Vous avez rompu l'intégralité de la Fractale. Vous avez désacralisé le Passage."
   },
   "source": "World/Quests/Ferris_indoor/Ferris_3_4_2/Portal_Sub6.(ClientData).xdb"
  },
  {
   "n": 10,
   "start": 57.5,
   "duration": 17.0,
   "speaker": null,
   "voice": {
    "event": "Cutscenes/Ferris4/CS_FR_PortalArch03",
    "wave": "CS_FR_PortalArch03",
    "bank": "SFX/Voice/Voice_CS_FR602_cs_rus.bsb",
    "ogg": "voice/10.ogg",
    "mp3": "voice/10.mp3",
    "duration": 6.198
   },
   "clips": [],
   "animations": [],
   "text": {
    "ru": "Лишние эмоции, лишняя суета, лишняя жизнь... Хаосу нет пути в наш мир.",
    "en": "Needless emotions, needless haste, needless life... The chaos cannot enter our world.",
    "fr": "Des émotions inutiles, une précipitation inutile, une vie inutile... Le chaos ne peut pas entrer dans notre monde."
   },
   "source": "World/Quests/Ferris_indoor/Ferris_3_4_2/Portal_Sub7.(ClientData).xdb"
  }
 ],
